  "title": "Chana Masala",
  "subtitle": "Chickpeas in a tangy, spiced tomato sauce",
  "excerpt": "Chana masala is a North Indian staple that is quick to make and deeply flavoured. Canned chickpeas take on the tomato and spice base readily, and the lemon juice stirred in at the end gives the dish its characteristic sharpness. It is good with rice, flatbreads, or on its own.",
