              "symptom": "The chickpeas taste bland",
              "cause": "Canned chickpeas need time to absorb the sauce",
              "fix": "Add a splash more water, cover, and simmer for another 10 minutes. Mashing a few chickpeas against the side of the pan also helps thicken and flavour the dish."
